/// <reference types="bun" />

/**
 * @file Stocks Application
 * One page over the static stock feed (api/stocks/**) generated by
 * scripts/update-data.ts: a searchable catalog of Nasdaq, NYSE and Cboe stocks
 * with valuation, dividend, balance sheet, growth, margin and return columns,
 * a Watchlist of the stocks you tick, and per-stock detail tabs (Overview,
 * Fundamentals, Dividends, History). Same look, feel and interaction model as
 * the ETFs apps. No build step, no bundler.
 *
 * Babel standalone note: the inline pipeline strips type annotations, but it
 * does not accept every TypeScript-only expression. Follow the sibling dev
 * style: plain `byId()` instead of DOM casts, no `as` casts, no non-null
 * `!`, no interfaces or enums.
 */

